{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":267683,\"title\":\"Doc McStuffins: Friendship Is The Best Medicine\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The doc is in! Meet Doc McStuffins, an amazing six-year-old girl with a very special talent: She has the ability to talk to and heal toys! Together with her trusty friends - Lambie, Stuffy, Hallie and Chilly - Doc treats and helps all toys and stuffed animals that need their boo boos fixed, ouchies kissed and problems solved. Whether it's a raspy walkie-talkie with Staticosis, a toy crab with Claw-be-gone-itis or just a little doll who needs a big hug, Doc McStuffins is on call 24/7 to help everyone discover the importance of taking care of themselves and others. Treat your little one to five fun-filled episodes packed with laughter, music and adventure that prove Friendship is the Best Medicine!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bCCV3TQo5RQkxBjLW3TW28N5PLt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szBA7roL6CkKNupKpk2LinOf9Hb.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":120,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"Doc McStuffins\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":267683,\"title\":\"Doc McStuffins: Friendship Is The Best Medicine\",\"year\":2012,\"rating\":10},{\"id\":337409,\"title\":\"Doc McStuffins: Time For Your Check Up\",\"year\":2013,\"rating\":0},{\"id\":260858,\"title\":\"Doc Mcstuffins: A Little Cuddle Goes A Long Way\",\"year\":2014,\"rating\":5},{\"id\":318234,\"title\":\"Doc McStuffins: Mobile Clinic\",\"year\":2014,\"rating\":0},{\"id\":337797,\"title\":\"Doc Mcstuffins: School of Medicine\",\"year\":2014,\"rating\":0},{\"id\":323910,\"title\":\"Doc McStuffins: Cuddle Me Lambie\",\"year\":2015,\"rating\":5.5}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"poster\":\"ht